Error [E0108]: Field `value` holds Int (a whole number), but this value is String (text)
  --> field_assignment_type_mismatch.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     box.value = "wrong"
    |                 ^^^^^^^
 Why: A field keeps one type for its whole life
 Fix: Use Int (a whole number) here
